Upstream: https://github.com/qt/qtbase/tree/v6.8.4-lts-lgpl
Tab simplifications: horizontal text-only cell labels; no drag, icons, RTL,
vertical shapes or scroll buttons. Existing cell allocation/elision replaces
pixel layout. Native header close controls use one completed left click instead
of canvas press/release; headers have no keyboard focus. Borrowed corner actions
replace Qt corner widgets. The consumer supplies native windows; buffer pages are borrowed,
widget pages owned. Duplicate addTab selects an existing page; the widget
uses SelectPreviousTab for on-demand pages. Close requests do not delete pages.

